 'Hartnell 12331, 18353, 19518; Long Beach City 43802, 46290; Palo Verde 04436: read live with md5 at ~21:09Z, every digest checked locally, removed by an md5-guarded delete; the receipt holds each row as Postgres printed it and the rollback (cpl-project-tracker#2394). The push went through in its own command.',
 'The S456 method: one query whose answer the harness saves to a file, a script that checks md5(row_text) and writes the receipt and the delete, one command per step.',
