('measured-count-verifies-a-rebuild-2026-10-23', 'procedure', 'cpl',
 'A measured count verifies a rebuild of lost work: rebuild from the written rule, accept it when the first session''s counts come out the same',
 'S457''s scorer change died with its container; its PR body kept the rule and three counts (258, 9, 738; Hartnell 7). S459 rebuilt and matched 258, 9 and 7. A different count is a different rule. Write the rule and a count at build time.',
 'KB note docs/kb-notes/methodology-a-measured-count-verifies-a-rebuild.md.',
